```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
target/

# TypeScript build info
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Compiled JavaScript/TypeScript
**/*.js.map
**/*.d.ts
**/*.d.ts.map

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python cache (if any Python files exist in the project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
*.coverage

# Distribution / packaging
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.gz

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```